{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SA78O6j5bV1792801895.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>由中國富商創立，並獲日本軟銀支持的金融支付平台OPay，計劃在美國發行ADR預託證券，集資最多3.36億美元。</p><p></p><p>監管文件顯示，總部設於新加坡，主要市場在尼日利亞等新興市場的OPay，計劃發售1,600萬份ADR，每份作價介乎19至21美元。每份ADR相當於公司10股普通股。</p><p></p><p>總部設於英國的投資公司Redwheel，南非資產管理公司Coronation Investment Management International，以及挪威投資公司Sundt，已承諾共買入2.7億份ADR。渣打集團則會買入OPay的私人配售普通股。OPay由內地富豪周亞輝，於2017年創立。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:24:24.975167+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":285,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.025381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:27.096893+00:00","content_hash":"e742ac1291d6e8587b6d7f0fdb56580703f50956a0886e958b5eee05f2d8185b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T01:24:24.975167+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}